   function Fit_Tensor_Pspline (Bases : B_Spline_Basis_Vector; Points : Long_Float_Vector_Vector; Values : Long_Float_Vector; Lambdas : Long_Float_Vector) return Tensor_B_Spline;
   --  Fits a tensor-product P-spline: least squares plus an anisotropic difference penalty, solving (B^T B + P) c = B^T y with P from tensor_difference_penalty().
   --
   --  Calls C++ datamunge::fda::fit_tensor_pspline.
